WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.548
Three contributions.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:07.177
First,

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:10.805
momentum SGD iterates converge almost surely to a
connected set of stationary points,

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:14.433
even for non-convex losses.

00:00:14.513 --> 00:00:18.062
Second, it quantifies mSGD's rate, explaining
momentum's acceleration.

00:00:18.142 --> 00:00:21.690
Third, standard norm-form AdaGrad also converges
almost surely.
